# Wind-tunnel docker build context exclusions.
# Goal: the context matches a fresh checkout (tracked files + ad4m submodule).
# The image builds its own node_modules and dist; host copies only add bulk
# and let stale output mask a broken build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
**/.git
.certs
.codegraph
# Python services (virtualenvs, training data) — not part of the Node image.
services
**/.venv*
**/__pycache__
*.test.ts
*.spec.ts
.DS_Store
